<title>USA: Omaha hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3   220-260 lbs   59.00</p>
<p>US  2-3   260-280 lbs   58.00-58.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Steady. Top 47.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    46.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    47.00-47.50</p>
</text>
